<title>HONG KONG: Fortei 1996 net profit jumps sharply.</title>
<headline>Fortei 1996 net profit jumps sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.3    vs 1.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0    vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			     21.10 vs   6.997</p>
<p>    Turnover		     286.06 vs 285.66</p>
<p>    Company name		 Fortei Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 19-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 26</p>
<p>NOTE - Shoe maker Fortei Holdings announced a total dividend for the year of 3.0 H.K. cents (including an interim dividend of one cent) vs one cent.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
